   "Bluetooth_headset_(Русский)": {
    "title": "Bluetooth headset (Русский)",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title>Bluetooth headset (Русский)</title><script>window.RLQ = [];</script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./_mw_/site.css\"></head><body><main id=\"content\"><h1 id=\"firstHeading\">Bluetooth headset (Русский)</h1><div id=\"mw-content-text\"><div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>Bluetooth headset: перевод статьи Bluetooth headset. Bluetooth headset настройка.</p></div><div id=\"catlinks\" class=\"catlinks\">Categories: <a href=\"Category%3ASound\">Sound</a></div></div></main></body></html>"
   },
   "Bluetooth_headset": {
    "title": "Bluetooth headset",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title>Bluetooth headset</title><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Bluetooth_headset\"><script>window.RLQ = [];</script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./_mw_/site.css\"></head><body><main id=\"content\"><h1 id=\"firstHeading\">Bluetooth headset</h1><div id=\"mw-content-text\"><div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"related\"><p>Related articles</p><ul><li><a href=\"Bluetooth\" title=\"Bluetooth\">Bluetooth</a></li></ul></div><p>There are three Bluetooth audio systems for a headset: A2DP for music, HFP and HSP for calls, and LE Audio.<sup class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\">[1]</a></sup></p><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Headset_via_PipeWire\">Headset via PipeWire<span class=\"mw-editsection\">[edit]</span></h2></div><p>PipeWire sets up Bluetooth headsets on its own.</p><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Troubleshooting\">Troubleshooting</h3></div><h4 id=\"High_audio_volume\">High audio volume</h4><p>When the volume is too loud, turn off hardware volume in WirePlumber.</p><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Headset_via_PulseAudio\">Headset via PulseAudio</h2></div><p>Install pulseaudio-bluetooth. See <a href=\"PipeWire#Bluetooth_devices\">PipeWire</a> and <a href=\"#Headset_via_PipeWire\">above</a>.</p><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"cite_note-1\">A note.</li></ol></div><div id=\"catlinks\" class=\"catlinks\">Categories: <a href=\"Category%3ASound\">Sound</a></div></div></main></body></html>"
   },
   "Bluetooth": {
    "title": "Bluetooth",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title>Bluetooth</title><script>window.RLQ = [];</script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./_mw_/site.css\"></head><body><main id=\"content\"><h1 id=\"firstHeading\">Bluetooth</h1><div id=\"mw-content-text\"><div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>Bluetooth is a short range wireless standard for exchanging data between devices, such as a headset.</p></div><div id=\"catlinks\" class=\"catlinks\">Categories: <a href=\"Category%3ASound\">Sound</a></div></div></main></body></html>"
   },
   "Bluetooth_(Español)": {
    "title": "Bluetooth (Español)",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title>Bluetooth (Español)</title><script>window.RLQ = [];</script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./_mw_/site.css\"></head><body><main id=\"content\"><h1 id=\"firstHeading\">Bluetooth (Español)</h1><div id=\"mw-content-text\"><div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>Bluetooth es un estándar inalámbrico para un headset.</p></div><div id=\"catlinks\" class=\"catlinks\">Categories: <a href=\"Category%3ASound\">Sound</a></div></div></main></body></html>"
