    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title>systemd/User</title><script>window.RLQ = [];</script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./_mw_/site.css\"></head><body><main id=\"content\"><h1 id=\"firstHeading\">systemd/User</h1><div id=\"mw-content-text\"><div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>systemd can manage services under the user's control with a per-user instance, enabling them to start and stop their own user units.</p><p><a href=\"../Systemd\" title=\"Systemd\">systemd</a>, <a href=\"#Automatic_start-up\">start-up</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://man.archlinux.org/man/systemd.special.7#UNITS\">a man page</a>, <a href=\"http://plain.example.org/x?y=1&amp;z=2\">plain</a>, <a href=\"javascript:alert(1)\">bad</a>, <a href=\"../_res_/logo.png\"><img src=\"../_res_/logo.png\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" onerror=\"alert(1)\"></a></p><h2 id=\"Automatic_start-up\">Automatic start-up</h2><p>Enable lingering.</p></div><div id=\"catlinks\" class=\"catlinks\">Categories: <a href=\"Category%3ASound\">Sound</a></div></div></main></body></html>"
